{"seq":1,"slug":"protein-structure-function","title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质结构与功能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/protein-science/protein-structure-function","wordCount":1428,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-分子生物学-蛋白质结构与功能\">研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质结构与功能</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>蛋白质是生命活动的直接执行者，其三维结构决定了分子功能。从线性氨基酸链到精确折叠的三维构象，蛋白质结构的每一层级都携带着功能信息。研究生阶段的蛋白质结构生物学聚焦于结构测定方法、折叠机制、构象动力学以及 AI 驱动的结构预测革命。</p>\n<p>核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>结构层级</strong>：一级（序列）、二级（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>-螺旋、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-折叠）、三级（结构域折叠）、四级（亚基组装）</li>\n<li><strong>蛋白质折叠</strong>：Anfinsen 实验证明折叠信息编码于序列中</li>\n<li><strong>分子伴侣</strong>：GroEL/GroES、HSP70 辅助正确折叠</li>\n<li><strong>结构测定</strong>：X 射线晶体学、冷冻电镜（cryo-EM）、NMR</li>\n<li><strong>AlphaFold</strong>：AI 结构预测的突破</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"蛋白质的结构层级\">蛋白质的结构层级</h3><p><strong>一级结构</strong>：20种标准氨基酸通过肽键连接形成多肽链。序列决定了后续所有结构层级。</p>\n<p><strong>二级结构</strong>：主链氢键驱动的局部规则构象。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>氢键模式</th>\n<th>每圈残基</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi/\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span></span> 角</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>-螺旋</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\to i+4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>3.6</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>57</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>47</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-57°/-47°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">57°/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">47°</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-折叠</td>\n<td>链间</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>139</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>135</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-139°/+135</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">139°/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">135</span></span></span></span></span>（反平行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3_{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-螺旋</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\to i+3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>3.0</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>49</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>26</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-49°/-26°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">49°/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26°</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Ramachandran 图</strong>：描绘主链二面角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span></span> 的允许区域，是评估蛋白质结构质量的重要工具。</p>\n<p><strong>三级结构</strong>：整条多肽链的三维折叠。驱动力包括疏水效应（主要）、氢键、范德华力、离子键和二硫键。</p>\n<p><strong>四级结构</strong>：多个亚基的组装，如血红蛋白的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_2\\beta_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 四聚体。亚基间通过非共价相互作用结合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"蛋白质折叠\">蛋白质折叠</h3><p><strong>Anfinsen 实验</strong>（1973 Nobel）：变性的核糖核酸酶 A 在去除变性剂后可自发重折叠恢复活性，证明折叠信息编码在一级结构中。</p>\n<p><strong>Levinthal 悖论</strong>：一个 100 残基的蛋白质有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>48</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^{100} \\sim 10^{48}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">48</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种构象，随机搜索需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>30</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{30}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 年，但实际折叠在毫秒到秒级完成。</p>\n<p><strong>折叠漏斗模型</strong>：蛋白质折叠的能量地形像一个粗糙的漏斗，天然态位于底部（全局自由能最低点）。折叠路径不唯一，但总趋势是能量下降。</p>\n<p><strong>分子伴侣系统</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HSP70/HSP40</strong>：结合疏水暴露区域，防止聚集</li>\n<li><strong>GroEL/GroES（HSP60）</strong>：封闭腔内提供折叠环境</li>\n<li><strong>HSP90</strong>：辅助信号蛋白（激酶、转录因子）的成熟</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"蛋白质错误折叠与疾病\">蛋白质错误折叠与疾病</h3><p>蛋白质错误折叠导致的聚集体（淀粉样纤维）与多种神经退行性疾病相关：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>疾病</th>\n<th>蛋白质</th>\n<th>聚集体特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Alzheimer</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-42, Tau</td>\n<td>老年斑、神经原纤维缠结</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parkinson</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>-synuclein</td>\n<td>Lewy 小体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>朊病毒病</td>\n<td>PrP<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{Sc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>传染性淀粉样纤维</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐冻症（ALS）</td>\n<td>SOD1, TDP-43</td>\n<td>运动神经元包涵体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>淀粉样纤维的共同特征是 cross-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 结构——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-折叠链垂直于纤维轴排列。</p>\n<h3 id=\"结构测定方法\">结构测定方法</h3><p><strong>X 射线晶体学</strong>：通过蛋白质晶体对 X 射线的衍射模式计算电子密度图。分辨率可达 1-2 Å，但需要获得晶体（瓶颈）。</p>\n<p><strong>冷冻电镜（cryo-EM）</strong>：快速冷冻蛋白质溶液，直接成像。近年&quot;分辨率革命&quot;使其达到 2-3 Å 分辨率。优势：不需要晶体，可处理大分子复合物和多构象。</p>\n<p><strong>核磁共振（NMR）</strong>：在溶液中测定结构，可获得动力学信息。适用于小蛋白（&lt;40 kDa）。</p>\n<p><strong>AlphaFold2</strong>（2020）：DeepMind 开发的 AI 系统在 CASP14 竞赛中达到了接近实验精度的结构预测。AlphaFold 数据库已预测了超过 2 亿个蛋白质结构，彻底改变了结构生物学的研究范式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"酶催化机制\">酶催化机制</h3><p>酶通过降低反应的活化能加速化学反应：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = A \\cdot e^{-E_a/(RT)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>催化策略包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>酸碱催化</strong>：质子转移</li>\n<li><strong>共价催化</strong>：形成酶-底物共价中间体</li>\n<li><strong>金属离子催化</strong>：Lewis 酸、氧化还原</li>\n<li><strong>近邻效应和定向效应</strong>：将反应物聚集并正确定位</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>利用 Ramachandran 图解释为什么甘氨酸比其他氨基酸有更多允许的构象。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论 AlphaFold 预测的结构与实验测定结构在哪些方面可能存在差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个实验来研究某蛋白质的折叠中间体（提示：氢氘交换质谱、停流荧光）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么朊病毒可以&quot;传染&quot;——PrP<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{Sc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 如何将 PrP<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>C</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 转化为错误折叠形式。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 cryo-EM 和 X 射线晶体学的优缺点，讨论各自的最佳应用场景。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Branden &amp; Tooze《Introduction to Protein Structure》是蛋白质结构的经典入门教材。</li>\n<li>Fersht《Structure and Mechanism in Protein Science》从物理化学角度深入讨论折叠和催化。</li>\n<li>Jumper et al. (2021) &quot;Highly accurate protein structure prediction with AlphaFold&quot; 是 AlphaFold 的原始论文。</li>\n<li>Chiti &amp; Dobson (2017) &quot;Protein Misfolding, Amyloid Formation, and Human Disease&quot; 是错误折叠病的权威综述。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>蛋白质结构与功能的关系是分子生物学的核心命题。从序列到结构，折叠过程通过能量漏斗模型理解，分子伴侣在活细胞中保障折叠的保真性。结构测定从传统的晶体学和 NMR 扩展到冷冻电镜的分辨率革命和 AlphaFold 的 AI 预测革命。错误折叠导致的蛋白质聚集病揭示了折叠问题的医学重要性。结构生物学正在从&quot;单个蛋白质结构&quot;向&quot;蛋白质组水平结构预测&quot;和&quot;动态构象集合&quot;的方向快速发展。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质结构与功能","id":"研究生-分子生物学-蛋白质结构与功能"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"蛋白质的结构层级","id":"蛋白质的结构层级"},{"level":3,"text":"蛋白质折叠","id":"蛋白质折叠"},{"level":3,"text":"蛋白质错误折叠与疾病","id":"蛋白质错误折叠与疾病"},{"level":3,"text":"结构测定方法","id":"结构测定方法"},{"level":3,"text":"酶催化机制","id":"酶催化机制"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — RNA 生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/gene-expression/rna-biology"},"next":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质组学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/protein-science/proteomics"}}